<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Ryder System Inc to neutral from outperform, a source at Smith Barney said. </p>
<p>-- Analyst Thano Hasiotis later confirmed downgrade.</p>
<p>-- Said shares had achieved price target of $33 per share.</p>
<p>-- Hasiotis said he cut his 1997 earnings estimate and started a 1998 estimate &quot;well below management's guidance&quot; but declined to offer further specifics on the action.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-1/8 to 30-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
